            "text": "Octoverse 2025: AI, India, and the new #1 programming language Dive into the key findings from Octoverse 2025! This year saw record-breaking growth with over 180 million developers now on GitHub. We explore three big shifts: generative AI becoming ordinary engineering, TypeScript&#8217;s rise to the #1 language, and how AI is influencing developer choices. See how the developer map is redrawing itself faster than ever."
